WEBVTT

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:10.190
These are the traitors 
Guy-sama was talking about?

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.330
Maxim...

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.440
What's going on?

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:17.010
What happened?

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:21.200
Why don't I ever know anything?

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.330
What are you doing, young user of Entei?

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.840
Shouldn't you be preparing to head out?

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:31.590
Double...

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:36.200
The flying boat with the Buranki Oubu 
on board has passed the North Pole.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:41.180
Their objective is, most likely, to rescue 
Banryuu Reoko from her custody here.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:45.290
You are to defeat your brother, 
Kazuki Azuma, and Oubu,

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:47.810
and prove your strength to Guy-sama.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:49.600
All right.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:52.620
Don't forget why we entrusted Entei to you.

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:55.950
If you fail to live up to 
Guy-sama's expectations,

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:58.990
you will meet the same end as these fools.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.620
What did Maxim and his teammates do?!

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.870
They tried to take the 
Buranki Zampaza and leave,

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.260
for their own profit.

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:11.500
Their deaths were the 
punishment they deserved.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:14.690
Even so, if you kill all of them,

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:16.630
then even Zampaza...

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:23.330
We no longer need them to control Zampaza.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:24.990
What do you mean?

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:28.020
Don't get conceited, Kazuki Kaoruko.

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:31.150
That's not something you need to know.

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:54.170
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:54.170
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:09.190
BURANKI

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:12.860
BURANKI

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:16.650
BURANKI

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:36.550
Kazuki

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:36.550
Kaoruko

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:07.450
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:07.450
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:08.950
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:08.950
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:19.330
<i>Sorry to interrupt your break.</i>

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:20.500
<i>We'll be there soon.</i>

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:28.850
We've crossed the French border?

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:33.210
Yep. We'll arrive at their 
island fortress soon.

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:37.770
The plan to rescue Reoko-sama 
is about to begin at last!

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:49.230
Demokratia Headquarters 
"Island Fortress"

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.010
All right!

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:08.720
Tsuwabuki's made his move!

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:15.650
Hold on tight, kiddos!

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:32.100
Damn!

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:34.550
Epimew, of all things?

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:39.100
We cannot allow you, who oppose Monsieur Guy,

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:41.800
to advance any further.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:45.050
We will stop you here.

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:50.470
No!

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:59.750
That is the Buranki Oubu.

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:02.230
Laetitia-sama, take care 
not to lower your guard.

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:03.110
Yes!

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:15.000
We can't take a direct hit, Azuma!

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:15.910
Right!

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:32.890
Take care of Reoko-sama for me, Azuma!

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:42.070
<i>Azuma...</i>

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:45.860
What you kids need to do 
is create a diversion.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:51.310
Even with Oubu, capturing their 
island fortress will take time.

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:55.710
If Reoko-sama is moved out of the 
tower she's in before we're done,

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:57.750
it'll all be for nothing.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:01.440
So we'll have Tsuwabuki get Reoko-sama.

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:04.030
You kids make a commotion 
inside the fortress,

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:06.630
then join up with Tsuwabuki 
and get out of there.

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:15.820
It's been a long time, Azuma!

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:19.310
It looks like we were fated 
to battle it out after all!

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:20.350
Epizo?

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:21.930
Here we come!

00:06:21.930 --> 00:06:24.780
This is our Buranki, Mega-lala!

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:34.240
Wait, Epizo!

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.290
I'm here to save Reoko!

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.440
So I have to get through here!

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:41.420
<i>Epizo, why are you fighting?!</i>

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.590
Because Monsieur Guy ordered me to.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:47.340
Because he ordered you to? That's it?

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.360
That's it. Yes!

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:51.590
Do I need any other reason?

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:53.700
Because it's the right thing to do,

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:55.640
or because you have something to protect...

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.470
Or for love.

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:58.730
Enchanting...

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:01.080
Nothing! I've got nothing like that!

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.630
He's not just a fatso.

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:06.810
He's a bona fide idiot.

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:07.820
Yep. Yep.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:11.200
The reason I fight?

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:19.390
No, Epizo! Don't try to use your head!

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:21.880
Yeah, yeah! You'll explode!

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:23.960
We work for Monsieur Guy!

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:28.710
So all we need to do is repel 
all who defy Monsieur Guy!

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:31.630
You, the heart, don't need 
to think about anything!

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:34.940
The heart doesn't think!

00:07:34.940 --> 00:07:36.710
Simple is best!

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:38.020
Thank you, Luis!

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:43.870
There you have it.

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:48.150
If you want to get past us, 
you'll have to beat me, Azuma!

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:51.760
All right. I will!

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:00.260
They're behind us, too!

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:04.050
Hey, Laetitia-chan!

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:08.000
Don't interfere in my 
man-to-man fight with Azuma!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:08.960
Back off!

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:13.080
F-For that... I deeply apologize.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:17.100
No... I also have a reason 
why I can't back down.

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.530
That hurt!

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:30.090
A love-love-lovers' spat?

00:08:30.090 --> 00:08:31.680
Azuma, now's our chance!

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:32.400
Right!

00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:45.600
A black Entei?

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:48.380
And it's got its limbs!

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:51.630
Kaoruko? Why are you in Entei?

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:54.730
You don't know anything, Azuma.

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:00.140
So that's Entei.

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:05.270
The Buranki that gave Banryuu 
Reoko an immortal body...

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:07.770
Azuma...

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:12.280
Why did you come all the way 
out here to save Reoko?

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.610
Because I promised I'd save her.

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:17.700
Huh? What does that mean?

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:21.620
Wait, are you saying you're 
in love with Reoko?

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:22.930
You idiot!

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:26.120
She looks young, but she's 
as old as our mom, you know!

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:28.300
She's <i>forty</i>!

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:29.080
<b>Yaaah!!</b>

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.130
She's a real-life middle-aged loli!

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:34.210
Real-life... middle-aged loli?

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:40.220
I swear.

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:43.820
It's like none of you have 
a care in the world.

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:46.020
After Maxim and his team have been killed...

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:49.810
After Guy killed all five of them...

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:53.070
What? What're you talking 
about, Kaoruko-chan?

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:57.490
He's right! Monsieur Guy 
would never do such a thing!

00:09:57.920 --> 00:09:59.990
If you don't believe me,

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:02.600
go down below the fortress

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:05.000
and take a look at the five 
of them in their coffins.

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:10.760
Whether you believe me 
or not is your choice.

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:17.010
But Guy is out to wipe every last 
Bubuki user off the face of this Earth.

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:18.760
They were killed?

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:21.970
The five who were in that Buranki?

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:27.030
They were...

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:29.140
killed?

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.030
Kaoruko...

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:39.110
If that's true, then why are you 
still following Guy's orders?!

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:43.450
Why? Did you just ask me why?

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.540
You know absolutely nothing!

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:54.420
Nothing! Nothing!

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:10.480
Why...

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:15.830
Why did I ever believe Guy?

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:27.950
<b>Episode 17
The Island Fortress</b>

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:27.950
<b><i>The Gentle Giants
of the Galaxy</i></b>

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.500
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:46.530
Laetitia, do you intend to keep fighting?

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:48.770
Guy played us all for fools!

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:53.540
It's not that I doubt Kaoruko-san's words,

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:55.800
but I trust Monsieur Guy.

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:58.780
No... I have to trust him.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:02.780
There is a reason I must fight.

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:04.710
A reason to fight?

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:18.330
Monsieur Guy said that if 
I become Entei's heart,

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:23.300
then Entei's regenerative 
power can heal my body.

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:29.690
There's no other way for me to 
have a body that can move freely.

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:33.310
My only chance is to fight 
so that Monsieur Guy will

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.440
acknowledge my talent and give me Entei!

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.310
Laetitia...

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:41.030
Laetitia-san, Guy is just fooling you, too!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.700
Just like Kaoruko!

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:47.880
I'm sorry, bearer of the 
Buranki Oubu's heart.

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:50.700
I cannot allow myself to 
listen to what you say.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:51.980
Azuma!

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:55.080
If she's not gonna listen, 
then we have to fight!

00:12:56.070 --> 00:12:58.500
Himekiri! Hoemaru!

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:25.490
A-chan! A-chan!

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.940
Users of the Buranki Oubu, this is the end.

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:31.190
I will finish you now.

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:38.500
Kaoruko...

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:48.580
Kaoruko?

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:52.380
<i>I'm going to let you save Reoko.</i>

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.300
<i>I don't want to accept it...</i>

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:58.000
<i>I'd rather die than accept it, but...</i>

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:00.020
<i>I need your help</i>

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:03.280
to defeat Guy.

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:04.580
Kaoruko...

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:11.950
The leg is regenerating.

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.600
So that is the regenerative 
power the Buranki have?

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:20.500
If I become Entei's heart, 
I'll have that power, too?

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:25.920
I won't let you pass!

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:48.380
It hurts, it burns, I'm crying...

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:50.760
But it's a hundred times better than dying!

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:53.600
And it's a hundred million times 
better than being killed!

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:54.900
Guy won't...

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:57.500
Guy won't get away with 
this if I can help it!

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:08.010
<i>Guy-sama...</i>

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:11.190
<i>Should we continue the battle?</i>

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:13.760
Yes, of course.

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:18.300
We need to know how long anyone besides 
Reoko, the now-immortal heart,

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:22.220
can hold out while controlling Entei.

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:27.610
To gather this data,
Kaoruko will be our guinea pig.

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.320
<i>Understood.</i>

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:46.060
There is no need for Bubuki and 
Buranki in this beautiful world.

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:52.470
Hurry up and go get Reoko!

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:55.720
What the heck is the deal with Entei?

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:58.350
Just being in it makes me 
feel like I'm burning alive!

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:00.150
Kaoruko...

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:03.350
All right. We'll get Reoko out of there!

00:16:03.680 --> 00:16:04.860
Just wait here!

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:17.150
Laetitia-sama, we should withdraw!

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:19.150
Your body can't withstand any more!

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:26.450
All that damage has been 
completely healed...

00:16:26.890 --> 00:16:29.300
That is Entei's power?

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:35.790
Laetitia-sama, please listen 
to me! For your own sake!

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:37.400
Don't stop me.

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:40.820
Just a bit longer...

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:44.330
Humor me for just a bit longer.

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:48.320
If I become Entei's heart, 
my wish will be granted.

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:52.570
I want to walk outside with everyone else.

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:56.500
With my own legs, my own strength...

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:59.080
That's all I want.

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:04.080
So I can't withdraw!

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:19.640
Sorry, but I need to keep you from 
flying for a while, Laetitia!

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:26.530
Epizo?

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:28.520
What do you think you're doing?

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:32.890
<i>After all this, are you still 
going to be Guy's pawn?</i>

00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:34.860
I quit being Guy's pawn earlier.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.140
Huh?

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:38.530
<i>It's not Guy I'm fighting for.</i>

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:40.530
It's Laetitia.

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:41.700
Huh?

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:43.580
Laetitia...

00:17:44.090 --> 00:17:47.290
I heard everything you just said.

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:50.090
So that's your reason for fighting.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:53.710
<i>In that case, let me help you.</i>

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:56.590
<i>Let me help you make your wish come true.</i>

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:58.510
Epizo...

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:02.020
That's my new reason for fighting.

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:09.130
What... What is this?

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:12.020
Is today Confess Your Love Day or something?

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:19.290
No matter how many junky Buranki 
you people throw at me,

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:21.870
you're no match for Kaoruko-sama!

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:29.290
Wh-What is this?

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:33.370
What's going on? I can't control Entei!

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.690
My strength is returning.

00:18:43.690 --> 00:18:45.840
Is Entei near?

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:05.850
Reoko-sama!

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:07.500
Reoko-sama!

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:12.670
Inside the flames again?

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:19.050
Reoko!

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:21.260
Son of Migiwa...

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:24.800
Reoko, we're here to save you. Let's go.

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:28.850
Leave me and go, son of Migiwa.

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:30.020
Huh?

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:34.650
I sense that the seal on Entei 
is broken, and it is close.

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:40.030
But my strength has not 
yet returned completely.

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:45.660
If I jumped from here right 
now, I believe I could die.

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:51.580
Don't say dumb things like that.

00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:20.430
You fool.

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:22.980
Why did you save me?

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:26.780
How does saving me benefit 
you, son of Migiwa?

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:31.320
Don't ever do that again.

00:20:31.320 --> 00:20:34.620
Dying just because you can... That's...

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:43.430
Come on, let's go, Reoko.

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:45.440
Everyone's waiting.

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:04.950
A-chan! A-chan, where are you?

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:04.950
I can't believe Oubu's fusion came undone.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:08.950
A-chan! Hey, A-chan!

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:07.030
This is bad.

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.950
Something must have happened to Azuma.

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:12.140
Azuma!

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:13.210
Reoko...

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:17.330
I apologize, but I must ask for your help.

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:37.080
Good grief.

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:41.390
Those kids took all the glory.
